Compatibility defect found and fixed during validation
  In A-compatible databases, an empty text literal is NULL.  The original V2
  filter accumulator therefore dropped filters while concatenating from ''.
  P3-2 initially exposed three cross-tenant result mismatches.  The accumulator
  now assigns its first predicate explicitly and the fallback checks IS NOT NULL;
  both exact JSONB comparisons are zero after the fix.

